    "lesson.objective"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "028dd00214",
   "es": "Had + participio (past perfect) va con lo que pasó primero: When I got to the station, the train had left. By the time (para cuando) introduce el segundo momento: By the time we arrived, the movie had started.",
   "kinds": [
    "lesson.intro"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c2e9708521",
   "es": "Cuando llegué, el tren se había ido.",
