    "example"
   ],
   "en": "When I arrived, the train had left."
  },
  {
   "id": "a9d2307ccc",
   "es": "Usas had + participio para lo que pasó antes.",
   "kinds": [
    "lesson.takeaway"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "e0e8167bac",
   "es": "Ordenas dos momentos con by the time y when.",
